<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="tool-intro"><view class="tool-intro-kicker">效率处理 · 减少选择</view><view class="tool-intro-title">事情很多时，只决定第一件</view><view class="tool-intro-desc">每行写一件事，再标出重要或紧急。工具只帮你选出现在最该开始的一件。</view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section-title-row"><view class="section-title">今天脑子里的事</view><button class="example-chip" bindtap="fillExample" hover-class="example-chip--pressed">试试示例</button></view><view class="surface form-card"><textarea class="field-textarea task-input" value="{{inputValue}}" maxlength="600" placeholder="{{inputPlaceholder}}" placeholder-class="field-placeholder" bindinput="onInput" /><view class="helper task-helper">紧急优先于重要；同等级时，排在前面的先做。</view></view></view>
  <view class="section" wx:if="{{tasks.length}}"><view class="section-title">给任务加两个简单标记</view><view class="surface task-list"><view class="task-row" wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="text"><view class="task-name">{{item.text}}</view><view class="task-flags"><button class="flag {{item.important ? 'flag--active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-flag="important" bindtap="toggleFlag">重要</button><button class="flag flag--urgent {{item.urgent ? 'flag--urgent-active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-flag="urgent" bindtap="toggleFlag">紧急</button></view></view></view><button class="primary-button decide-button" bindtap="decide">告诉我先做什么</button></view>
  <view class="focus-result" wx:if="{{result}}"><view class="result-kicker">现在只做这一件</view><view class="result-title">{{result.text}}</view><view class="result-reason">{{result.urgent ? '因为它很紧急' : result.important ? '因为它很重要' : '先从清单第一件开始'}}</view><button class="done-button" bindtap="markDone">完成了，从清单移除</button></view>
  <button class="clear-all" wx:if="{{tasks.length}}" bindtap="clearAll">清空今天的清单</button>
  <view class="notice">这是任务排序辅助，不替你做重要决定。清单仅保存在当前设备。</view>
</view>
